* ==============================================================================
* IBM MQ Queue Manager and Application Queue Definitions
* Queue Manager: DOCUMENT.QM
* Dead Letter Queue: SYSTEM.DEAD.LETTER.QUEUE
* ==============================================================================

* Configure Queue Manager Dead-Letter Queue (DEADQ)
ALTER QMGR DEADQ('SYSTEM.DEAD.LETTER.QUEUE')

* Configure Queue Manager SSL/TLS Key Repository and Certificate Label
ALTER QMGR SSLKEYR('/mnt/mqm/ssl/key') CERTLABL('ibmwebspheremqdocumentqm')

* Configure SVRCONN Channel with TLS CipherSpec and Mutual TLS (mTLS) Client Certificate Authentication
ALTER CHL(DEV.APP.SVRCONN) CHLTYPE(SVRCONN) SSLCIPH('ANY_TLS12_OR_HIGHER') SSLCAUTH(REQUIRED)

* Backout Queue for repeatedly failing / poison pill messages
DEFINE QLOCAL('DOCUMENT.BACKOUT.QUEUE') REPLACE
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('DOCUMENT.BACKOUT.QUEUE') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)

* Success Queue for publishing completion notifications
DEFINE QLOCAL('DOCUMENT.SUCCESS.QUEUE') REPLACE
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('DOCUMENT.SUCCESS.QUEUE') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)

* Primary Request Queue with Backout Threshold (BOTHRESH=3) and Backout Queue Name (BOQNAME)
DEFINE QLOCAL('DOCUMENT.REQUEST.QUEUE') REPLACE BOTHRESH(3) BOQNAME('DOCUMENT.BACKOUT.QUEUE')
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('DOCUMENT.REQUEST.QUEUE') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)

* Permissions for Dead Letter Queue
SET AUTHREC PROFILE('SYSTEM.DEAD.LETTER.QUEUE') PRINCIPAL('app') OBJTYPE(QUEUE) AUTHADD(BROWSE,GET,INQ,PUT)
